1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
Trap number two is paying yourself last.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,234
Most people spend first and then save

3
00:00:04,234 --> 00:00:06,214
whatever is left, but there is never

4
00:00:06,214 --> 00:00:08,853
anything left. Wealthy people reverse the order.

5
00:00:08,853 --> 00:00:11,273
The moment money arrives, a fixed percentage

6
00:00:11,273 --> 00:00:13,802
moves to savings and investments, before rent,

7
00:00:13,802 --> 00:00:16,332
before coffee, before anything. Then you learn

8
00:00:16,332 --> 00:00:17,706
to live on the rest - and

9
00:00:17,706 --> 00:00:18,971
somehow, you always do.
